libxdf
------------------------------------------
LibXDF is a cross-platform C++ library for loading multimodal signals stored in
XDF (Extensible Data Format) files. It is used in the biosignal viewing
application SigViewer and the LSL application XDFStreamer and can also be
integrated into other C++ applications.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libpugixml-devel-1.9-1
  libpugixml1-1.9-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libxdf-devel-1.0.4-1bl1
  libxdf0-1.0.4-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libpugixml-devel-1.9-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/xdf-modules/libxdf

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/xdf-modules/libxdf/archive/refs/tags/v1.0.4.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libxdf-1.0.4-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libxdf-1.0.4-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libxdf-1.0.4-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libxdf-1.0.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libxdf0-1.0.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libxdf-devel-1.0.4-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libxdf)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libxdf.README
  /usr/share/doc/libxdf/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/libxdf/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libxdf/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/libxdf/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md

(libxdf0)
  /usr/bin/cygxdf-0.dll

(libxdf-devel)
  /usr/include/xdf.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/libxdf/libxdfConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/libxdf/libxdfConfigVersion.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/libxdf/libxdfTargets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/libxdf/libxdfTargets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libxdf.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libxdf.pc

